        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This place... is filled with fallen Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The blood from his wounds had been frozen, but his other body parts remained intact.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is Frostleaf's technique.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Those ruins over there look like they were caused by explosives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's probably Meteorite's work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Frostleaf... Jessica... Meteorite... I'm sure they're still alive...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": 0,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, all the rescue squads have reached Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've extracted all the recon squads except for Meteorite's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "No Operators were lost on this mission, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone suffered frostbite with varying degrees of severity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must take note of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Frostbite?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "All our recon squads observed a special group of Reunion troops wandering around the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unlike the reckless Reunion soldiers we're used to fighting, these members had a special way of fighting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be cautious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I.... I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, am I clear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I understand.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I also have some things to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, even if Dr. {@nickname} is very helpful, you can't rely too much on a single person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, mind the rings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit actually worries about you a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we realized it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dangerous beasts have bared their fangs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Reunion is bearing down upon us.;Our retreat has been cut off...;These thugs really have it out for us.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... They will do everything they can to keep us from getting away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, we didn't come here to run away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island will break through their ranks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going to rescue Meteorite's squad!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Projekt Red, do you copy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh, yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. I'll meet you at the slums' east entrance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm. It'll just be the two of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just the two of us are more than enough to fight against Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
